# DEVLOG.ai — notes for the next model (and for Grok)

You are reading the kit at NOVA_fieldkit_v1_4. Python package `nova`.
Windows TUF host. Do not overwrite `data/NOVA.db`. Overlay code only.

## Why the GUI looks like a poster
Steward supplied a cosmic-console mockup (aqueduct, NOVA wordmark,
spawn status, neon tiles, job board, Grok-in-the-mirror).
The live app is a *client* of SQLite + the daemon. It does not own
the scheduler. Tiles are data: `nova/gui/deck.json`.

## How to change the deck without rewriting app.py
1. Edit `nova/gui/deck.json`.
2. `live: false` = visible dead button (gray, tooltip = `why`).
3. `panel` = QStackedWidget index, or null if the tile is only a label.
4. Restart `python -m nova.gui`.
5. New pane: add a widget in `app.py`, give it the next index, point a tile at it.

## Spawn (do not regress)
Never `cmd /c start TITLE python`. Windows treats TITLE as the exe.
Use `nova.spawnutil.spawn(args, name, cwd)` which:
- CREATE_NEW_CONSOLE
- records pid in `data/artifacts/spawns.json`
- `alive(pid)` via OpenProcess / tasklist

Call sites: `launch.py`, `pocket.ensure_serve`.

## Pipes the GUI must show
- jobs table + queue rows (SYSTEM OPS)
- URL drop -> `board.enqueue_url` -> job `ingest` every 15s -> `web.fetch`
- packets inbox -> `office.deliver_inbox` (job `mail`)
- bites after each tick
- palace table viewer
- viewport stills + moondream if tag exists
- spawn PID list

## Speech
Parser peels `[speak voice]`, `[NOTICE]`, `SPEAK:`, `**speak**`.
Serve TTS is form POST `text` + `voice_url` to :8000.
Seats map in `pocket.SEATS`.

## Models
`state["model"]` in TUI/GUI combo wins. Do not steal short questions
to 0.5b when the steward picked an 8b.

## Dead by design (this loop)
KILL tile — needs HIL before any TerminateProcess.
TUI tile — launching a console from Qt is optional later.

## Website vs metal
See STAGING/WEBSITE_CHECKLIST.txt. Glass grok.me is not this process.

## Version
1.7 field kit. Next number when GUI deck.json + spawn status ship
and steward accepts the overlay.

If you add a feature: one paragraph here + one line in DEVLOG.txt.
Write for a model that has only this folder.

## v1.8 (Grok Bot cut)
Leash animals via mail. breaklog is mandatory on job exceptions.
brain.complete(provider=ollama.local|openai.compat|xai.grok stub).
Do not enable xAI HTTP until data/secrets/xai_api_key.txt exists.
cam: = features path; camsee: = optional moondream (steward heat).

## 2026-09-19 crawl + RAG gate
- nova/crawl.py: g3 heritage, same_host exploration, optional enqueue_web to board.
- nova/rag.py: TF overlap search + qwen2:0.5b INCLUDE/EXCLUDE gate before prompt.
- Deepened Textual + Qt docs into live chunks; python.org wander cleared.

### CRAWL (nova/crawl.py)
- Same-host directory exploration without network calls
- Produces temporary chunks for optional web enqueue
- TUI command: `/crawl URL`
- Daemon job: `crawl:URL` drains into ingest/tick
- Flow: crawl -> temp chunks -> board.enqueue_url -> web.fetch -> 0x-WEB or Tx-REJECT

### RAG GATE (nova/rag.py)
- Word/subject-weight search across palace knowledge
- Small model (qwen2:0.5b) INCLUDE/EXCLUDE filtering before large-prompt context
- Ax-RAG stamp on kept snippets; noise removed from conversation context
- Source facts stay written; only filtered excerpts enter prompt window
- Goal: deepen base with Textual + Qt docs first, then arXiv white papers later

